# The Tenshodo Showdown (windurst 69): the job operands with a job other than THF and WAR. A RDM at level 40, Mihgo's
# Amigo completed: not available: Nanaa Mihgo's default 76. Completed by GM (As Thick as Thieves available, level 40 <
# 50), a RDM: the completed section not met: 76.
lists WindurstWoods/Nanaa_Mihgo/onTrigger
char zone=WindurstWoods pos=66.5,-4.75,239.6 job=RDM lvl=40
quest Windurst.MihgosAmigo completed
login
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # a RDM: no section: 76
finish
quest Windurst.TheTenshodoShowdown completed   # GM
trigger Nanaa_Mihgo+99                         # completed, a RDM: 76
finish
